<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: fulfillment -->
  <VAspirE_Fulfillment.label>願望滿足</VAspirE_Fulfillment.label>
  <!-- EN: Fulfillment represents how happy someone is with their personal achievements in life. If they achieve their dreams and complete their lifetime goals, the fulfillment will increase. Each stage of fulfillment decreases mental break threshold. Achieving maximum fulfillment will result in a final growth moment. -->
  <VAspirE_Fulfillment.description>願望滿足值反映了人物達成願望後的喜悅程度。每當他們達成一個願望，願望滿足值就會隨之提高，此外還會降低其崩潰臨界值。願望滿足值達到最高時，他們將邁入新的成長時刻。</VAspirE_Fulfillment.description>
  
</LanguageData>